WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.452
You: This view is beautiful! Where is this? Can you find me a flight from Beijing to that city today?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.052
Realtime-Venus: That’s Shanghai. I will find today’s flight from Beijing.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.927
Realtime-Venus: I found twelve flights. I’d recommend the 3:00 PM flight from Beijing Capital to Shanghai Hongqiao, arriving at 5:20 PM.

